# A small weighted hypergraph for the hyper_sssp examples and the "Shortest hyperpaths" tutorial:
# one hyperedge per line, vertex ids 1..12 (1-based, as MOSP_ESCHER's files), '; w' the weight
# (the cost of entering the hyperedge). Hyperedge i (0-based) is the i-th line.
1 2 3 ; 4
3 4 ; 2
4 5 6 ; 7
2 7 ; 9
7 8 ; 3
6 8 9 ; 1
9 10 ; 5
10 11 12 ; 2
5 12 ; 8
